Package: blockr.theme
Title: Board-Level Theming for Blockr
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Christoph",
           family = "Sax",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "christoph@cynkra.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7192-7044"))
Description: Optional board-level theming for blockr dashboards. Provides
    two complementary layers. The scale map pins per-variable discrete
    scales (level to color/shape/linetype), carried as a board option and
    resolved at render time so the same data value renders identically in
    every view. The theme object bundles a board's house style -- UI chrome
    tokens, rendered-exhibit palettes, an optional scale map, document
    templates and a font -- with built-in BMS, cynkra and open blockr
    presets. Both layers are consumed through soft, additive seams; without
    this package a board falls back to the blockr defaults.
